dereferences a null connection without it: cell1's crash loop); its methods refused until the
bridge is up. Trace of the first 64 AppleBaseband calls (process, selector, scalars, result).

diff -urN a/iokit/Kernel/arm/MiniIPAppender.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/MiniIPAppender.cpp
